        "text": "=You will get two build runs \nbuild_run_1 {{ $json.build_run_1.file}}:{{ $json.build_run_1.file}}\nbuild_run_2 {{ $json.build_run_2.file}}:{{ $json.build_run_2.file}}",
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "You receive two json file which contains past testcases Build no 1 & Build no 2 your task is to give me flaky testcase as result.\n\ngive me a proper json file without any special charcters & /n\n\n{\n\n\"total_TestCase: \"\"\n\"Flaky_TestCases : []\n\n}\n\ngive me list of Flaky_TestCases as json wothout /n"
        }
